§§§ `33(4) -- the Attorney General`

-- src:700 | (4) The Attorney General may appeal against any decision of the Commissioner.
@ref Article 33(4) (src:700)
GIVEN appeal IS AN `Appeal under Article 33` @desc Who is appealing and against what decision
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 33(4) the Attorney General appeals a decision of the Commissioner` appeal MEANS
    appeal's appellant's `the Attorney General`

