      appeal IS AN `Appeal under Article 33` @desc Who is appealing, against what decision (its subject and outcome - IP27), and whether the decision concerns the appellant's own application or registration
      `the entity met the charity test at the time of the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc IP9: only read for a third party's appeal under Article 33(5)
      `the entity meets the charity test at the time of the appeal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc IP9: only read for a third party's appeal under Article 33(5)
      `the name is undesirable under Article 12(1) at the time of the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc IP18: only read for a third party's appeal under Article 33(5)
      `the name is undesirable under Article 12(1) at the time of the appeal` IS A BOOLEAN @desc IP18: only read for a third party's appeal under Article 33(5)
