    OR  way EQUALS `remit the decision to the Commissioner`
    OR  way EQUALS `substitute the decision of the court for that of the tribunal`
    OR  way EQUALS `substitute the decision of the tribunal or court for that of the Commissioner`
    OR  way EQUALS `dismiss the appeal`

